second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is \\\"The 1975\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 63, \"text\": \"Mike Crossey, known for his work with Arctic Monkeys and Foals.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"start\": 64, \"end\": 193, \"text\": \"The 1975 were selling out shows even before the debut of their full length as Healy recalls in an interview with \\\"The AU Review\\\".\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"start\": 194, \"end\": 269, \"text\": \"The lead single is a re-worked \\\"Sex\\\", which was released on 26 August 2013.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"start\": 270, \"end\": 387, \"text\": \"The song premiered on Zane Lowe's BBC Radio 1 show on 8 July 2013, and a music video premiered on YouTube on 26 July.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"start\": 388, \"end\": 444, \"text\": \"\\\"The 1975\\\" debuted at number one on the UK Albums Chart.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"start\": 445, \"end\": 535, \"text\": \"The 1975 toured in the UK in September 2013, among others performing in Kingston upon Hull\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 54, \"text\": \"and they 've been making music together since age 13 .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01\", \"start\": 55, \"end\": 177, \"text\": \"Prior to becoming the band 's lead singer and rhythm guitarist with the occasional piano , Healy originally played drums .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01\", \"start\": 178, \"end\": 447, \"text\": \"The musician told GQ about The 1975 's beginnings , explaining that he was approached by Adam Hann 's girlfriend at the time , who was recruiting on Hann 's behalf : `` 'My boyfriend wants to start a band and knows that you play drums , ' '' Healy recalled her saying .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01\", \"start\": 448, \"end\": 496, \"text\": \"`` We all met up , and I was the drummer , and I\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 92, \"text\": \"On Notes on a Conditional Form , the opening song deviates from the standard set of lyrics .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02\", \"start\": 93, \"end\": 249, \"text\": \"[ 11 ] Lasting 4 minutes and 57 seconds , `` The 1975 '' is a protest song and a work of ambient music , where Thunberg delivers a spoken word performance .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02\", \"start\": 250, \"end\": 487, \"text\": \"[ 9 ] [ 14 ] [ 15 ] [ 16 ] The lyrics call for civil disobedience to bring about reduction of greenhouse gas emissions in response to climate change , based on the January 2019 speech `` Our House Is on Fire `` , which Thunberg delivered\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 87, \"text\": \"second leg of The 2nd Law World Tour at the Emirates Stadium in London on 26 May 2013 .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03\", \"start\": 88, \"end\": 236, \"text\": \"[ 33 ] They also toured with the Neighbourhood in the United States in June 2013 , [ 34 ] and supported the Rolling Stones in Hyde Park on 13 July .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03\", \"start\": 237, \"end\": 343, \"text\": \"[ 35 ] In August , the band performed on the Festival Republic Stage at 2013 Reading and Leeds Festivals .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03\", \"start\": 344, \"end\": 485, \"text\": \"[ 36 ] In a feature article , Elliot Mitchell of When the Gramophone Rings wrote that releasing a string of EPs before the debut album was ``\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"The 1975\", \"scope\": \"general\", \"claim\": \"The 1975 is a band that debuted at number one on the UK Albums Chart.\", \"answer\": \"a band\", \"quote\": \"\\\"The 1975\\\" debuted at number one on the UK Albums Chart.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"The 1975\", \"scope\": \"song\", \"claim\": \"\\\"The 1975\\\" is a protest song and a work of ambient music.\", \"answer\": \"a protest song and a work of ambient music\", \"quote\": \"[ 11 ] Lasting 4 minutes and 57 seconds , `` The 1975 '' is a protest song and a work of ambient music , where Thunberg delivers a spoken word performance .\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"a band\", \"a protest song and a work of ambient music\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"a band\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"a protest song and a work of ambient music\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"a band that toured in the UK in September 2013\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"a band whose lead single was a reworked \\\"Sex\\\" released on 26 August 2013\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C4\", \"answer\": \"a band whose song premiered on Zane Lowe's BBC Radio 1 show on 8 July 2013\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C5\", \"answer\": \"a band formed when members were approached by Adam Hann's girlfriend to start a band\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C6\", \"answer\": \"a band whose members had been making music together since age 13\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C7\", \"answer\": \"a song featuring a spoken word performance by Thunberg\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C8\", \"answer\": \"a song calling for civil disobedience to reduce greenhouse gas emissions\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C9\", \"answer\": \"the name of a band's debut album\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C10\", \"answer\": \"a song advocating for civil disobedience to reduce greenhouse gas emissions\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
